* "American 5153" preamp, stage 1 of 7 (a three-channel head's service drawing 0070922000, supplied by the user): the input into V1B, the two gain networks that the relay K2
* selects, V2A and V2B, up to the coupling C25 (node n8). Channel GREEN (one) is every relay released; BLUE (two) energises K2 and K3; RED (three) is the other input stage.
* The preamp is cut into stages at coupling points and cathode followers so each matrix is small (the DC points and the sound are those of the single netlists):
* stage 1 here, 2: channel THREE's first tubes, 3: V3A / V3B, 4: channels ONE and TWO's tone stacks, 5: channel THREE's V5 / V6, 6: its tone stack, 7: the relay K1 and the loop.
* n8 is loaded by R84 + R57 (570k) of the next stage.

V VRAIL x 100 341
R R95 x w 10k
C C36 w 0 22u
C C40 x 0 47u
I VIN gin 1
R RSRC gin in 7k
R RPU1 gin pkb1 1e12
.xfmr LPU1 L=2.5
  W pkb1 in 1 pu
.end
R RPU2 gin pkb2 1e12
.xfmr LPU2 L=5
  W pkb2 in 1 pu
.end
C CPU gin in 110p
R RPL gin in 1e12
R SWK1 in pkk1 1e12
C CCAB1 pkk1 0 200p
R SWK2 in pkk2 1e12
C CCAB2 pkk2 0 400p
R SWK4 in pkk4 1e12
C CCAB4 pkk4 0 800p
R RIN in 0 1M
R R50 in g1b 10k
T V1B g1b p1b k1b 12AX7
R R34 w p1b 100k
R R51 k1b 0 1.5k
C C29 k1b 0 1u
C C6 p1b a1 4.7n
R R24 a1 b3 330k
C C11 a1 c11 220p
R R22 c11 b3 220k
R R23 b3 0 33k
R VR1T b3 w1 1
R VR1B w1 0 1
C C13 p1b c13 750p
R R25 c13 d6 180k
R R26 d6 0 150k
R VR6T d6 w6 1
R VR6B w6 0 1
R SW_K2A_ONE w1 m2 1
R SW_K2A_TWO w6 m2 1e12
C C23 m2 g2a 0.1u
R R52 g2a 0 1M
R R53 g2a 0 1M
T V2A g2a p2a k2a 12AX7
R R83 w p2a 100k
R R36 k2a 0 1.5k
C C18 k2a 0 22u
C C35 p2a n5 10n
R R35 n5 s35 330k
R SW_K2B_NO s35 0 1e12
R R80 n5 g2b 390k
R R55 g2b s55 68k
R SW_K2B_NC s55 0 1
R R58V2 g2b 0 180k
T V2B g2b p2b k2b 12AX7
R R77 w p2b 100k
C C24 w p2b 270p
R R54 k2b 0 1.5k
C C25 p2b n8 3.3n
R R_LOAD_N8 n8 0 570k
